This project adapts the latent-residual artifact-cleaning approach and compact
residual-network design described and implemented by:

  GPT Image 2 Artifact Cleaner
  Copyright (c) 2026 Larryvrh
  https://github.com/Larryvrh/gpt-image-2-artifact-cleaner
  PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0
  https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0

The original project's checkpoint is not included or redistributed. The residual
checkpoints for GPT Image Latent Refiner were trained separately from random
initialization on a self-curated dataset of 75 paired artifact/clean images. This
project adds a native ComfyUI node and separately trained Qwen Image, FLUX.2, and
SDXL VAE profiles.

Third-party VAE weights and the training dataset are not included in this
repository. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for their sources and license boundaries.
